{
  "name": "31 · Vigilante de deploys de Vercel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 31 · Vigilante de Vercel\n\n1. Crea un token en vercel.com → Account Settings → Tokens.\n2. Credencial Header Auth: nombre \"Authorization\", valor \"Bearer TU_TOKEN\".\n3. Si usas un equipo, añade ?teamId=... a la URL.\n4. Configura el canal de Slack y la hoja de Google Sheets.\n\nRevisa cada 15 minutos los últimos 20 deploys.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_111",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_112",
      "name": "Cada 15 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.vercel.com/v6/deployments",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "updateAParameterInEachRequest",
              "parameters": {
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "type": "qs",
                    "name": "until",
                    "value": "={{ $response.body.pagination.next }}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !$response.body.pagination || $response.body.pagination.next === null || !Array.isArray($response.body.deployments) }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 100,
              "requestInterval": 200
            }
          }
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "nodo_113",
      "name": "Consultar deploys de Vercel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Vercel (Authorization: Bearer)"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const pages = $input.all().map(i=>i.json);\nconst last = pages[pages.length-1] || {};\nconst complete = pages.length > 0 && pages.every(p=>Array.isArray(p.deployments)) && (last.pagination?.next === null || (!last.pagination && last.deployments?.length < 100));\nconst state = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst seen = state.deploy_states || {};\nconst unique = new Map();\nfor (const page of pages) for (const d of page.deployments || []) if (d.uid || d.id) unique.set(d.uid || d.id,d);\nconst failed=[];\nfor (const [id,d] of unique) {\n const status=d.state || d.readyState || '';\n if (status==='ERROR' && seen[id] !== 'ERROR') failed.push({id,proyecto:d.name || 'sin-nombre',url:d.url || ''});\n}\n// n8n persists static data only after a successful active execution. Failed notifications retry.\nif (complete) state.deploy_states = Object.fromEntries([...unique].map(([id,d])=>[id,d.state || d.readyState || '']));\nreturn [{json:{api_ok:complete,coverage_complete:complete,hay_fallos:failed.length>0,total_revisados:unique.size,total_paginas:pages.length,total_fallidos:failed.length,detalle_fallidos:failed.map(f=>f.proyecto+' ('+f.url+')').join(' | '),revisado_en:new Date().toISOString(),error:complete?null:'Incomplete or failed pagination; cursor not advanced'} }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_114",
      "name": "Evaluar deploys",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_014",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.api_ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
